class_name MountainStory
extends RefCounted
## Chapter four, "The Mountain That Remembers": the scenes StoryScene plays (the step language is in story_scene.gd). The owner's spec text is used word for
## word; its stage directions are played (walks, looks, effects, pauses) instead of narration cards. Lines marked DRAFT are Claude's.
##   mt_road (+ chapter card)   chains into mt_pass_pre, the first click on map 1       the opening on the old road
##   mt_pass_pre / mt_pass_post       Battle 1 The Forgotten Pass
##   mt_scout_pre / mt_scout_post     Battle 2 The Scout Who Never Returned   (Kaelen)
##   mt_siege_pre / mt_siege_post     Battle 3 The Endless Siege              (Gideon appears; the post scene ends in his challenge)
##   mt_last_pre / mt_last_post       Battle 4 The Last Commander             (the post scene ends with the Ancient Voice)
##   mt_heart_pre                     Battle 5 The Mountain's Heart           (Gideon and Kaelen as temporary allies)
##   mt_heart_post -> mt_oath -> mt_ahead   after Battle 5: the soldiers pass on, the new oath (they join: give_gk), the epilogue

